      "writtenOn": "2018-11-20T00:27:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My preference: From API design perspective, this is used by carriers to infer VoWiFi provisioning state from VoWiFi registration result. So we\u0027re really blocking ourselves.\n\nPractically though - if we really want to know what will break - this is not immediately a problem, as the carriers that uses this API AFAIK doesn\u0027t use the provisioning bit.",
